:: Temple Duties Monstrance Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'temple-manor-link'>>
  <<temple-duty-check>>
  <<if _dutySafe and $temple_rank is 'priest' and $TempleDuties.manor is 'accepted'
      and $location is 'kylarmanor' and C.npc.Kylar.init is 1
      and ['active', 'rescued'].includes(C.npc.Kylar.state)
      and C.npc.Kylar.rage lt 30 and !$stalk and !$controlled
      and Time.hour gte 18 and Time.hour lt 23
      and Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#passage-content .macro-link[data-passage]'))
        .some(link => link.dataset.passage === 'Kylar Chat')>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>>
    <<lanLink ['Ask whether Kylar wants to discuss the monstrance', '询问凯拉尔是否愿意谈圣体匣'] 'Revelation Temple Kylar'>>
    <</lanLink>>
    <br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'temple-manor-offer'>>
  <<if $temple_rank is 'priest' and $kylar_manor_secret is 3
      and $per_npc.bishop and $TempleDuties.manor is 'none'>>
    <br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>>
    <<lanLink ['Ask the bishop about the manor and your new duties', '向主教询问庄园与新的职务'] 'Revelation Temple Monstrance'>>
    <</lanLink>>
    <br>
  <<elseif $TempleDuties.manor is 'copied' and $per_npc.bishop
      and $TempleDuties.archive.topics.includes('monstrance')>>
    <br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>>
    <<temple-duty-action `['Deliver the notes Kylar agreed to share (£60, 0:05)', '交出凯拉尔同意提供的记录 (£60，0:05)']` 5 'Revelation Temple Monstrance End'>>
      <<if $TempleDuties.manor is 'copied'>>
        <<set $TempleDuties.manor to 'complete'>>
        <<historyskill 2>>
        <<money 6000 'templeDuty'>>
      <</if>>
    <</temple-duty-action>>
    <br>
  <<elseif $TempleDuties.manor is 'accepted'>>
    <br>
    <<refuseicon>>
    <<temple-duty-action `['Set the private investigation aside (0:01)', '放下这项私下调查 (0:01)']` 1 'Revelation Temple Monstrance Answer'>>
      <<set $TempleDuties.manor to 'declined'>>
    <</temple-duty-action>>
    <br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Revelation Temple Monstrance
<<temple-duty-place>>
<<if !_dutySafe or $temple_rank isnot 'priest' or $kylar_manor_secret isnot 3
    or !$per_npc.bishop or $TempleDuties.manor isnot 'none'>>
  <<temple-duty-back>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<loadNPC 0 'bishop'>>
<<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The bishop meets you beside the shadowed doorway. "A priest now," <<he>> says, smiling. "Jordan has good reason to trust you. And you have not forgotten what I told you about that house."
    You recall the hacked metal at the top of the monstrance, and Kylar asking why <<his>> parents had shown it to you. You unfold the sketch you made of it.
    "Compare what remains with our older descriptions," <<he>> says. "Take care with the child. Kinship makes some doors easier to open." <<His>> smile lingers. The index waits beneath <<his>> fingers. "The records office allows sixty pounds for a completed copy."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    主教在阴影中的门边接待你。“如今是司祭了，”<<he>>笑着说，“约旦有理由相信你。你也没有忘记我说过那所宅邸的事。”
    你想起圣体匣顶端被砍坏的金属，以及凯拉尔问父母为什么让你们看见它。你摊开那时画下的草图。
    “把留下的东西与我们的旧记录比一比，”<<he>>说，“对那孩子仔细些。亲近的人，能打开某些门。”<<His>>笑容停留着。索引压在<<his>>指下。“交来完整的副本，资料室会付六十英镑。”
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>>
<<temple-duty-action `['Agree to investigate after asking Kylar (0:05)', '答应调查，先问过凯拉尔 (0:05)']` 5 'Revelation Temple Monstrance Answer'>>
  <<set $TempleDuties.manor to 'accepted'>>
<</temple-duty-action>>
<br>
<<refuseicon>>
<<temple-duty-action `['Decline to investigate Kylar for the temple (0:05)', '拒绝为神殿调查凯拉尔 (0:05)']` 5 'Revelation Temple Monstrance Answer'>>
  <<set $TempleDuties.manor to 'declined'>>
<</temple-duty-action>>
<br>
<br>
<<temple-duty-back>>

:: Revelation Temple Monstrance Answer
<<temple-duty-place>>
<<loadNPC 0 'bishop'>>
<<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $TempleDuties.manor is 'accepted'>>
      "How carefully you draw the line," the bishop says. "We shall see what stands on either side." <<He>> gives you a reference to an old description in the records room. No promise of a cure accompanies it.
    <<else>>
      The bishop folds the reference away. "Jordan's duties will keep you busy enough," <<he>> says. You cannot tell whether <<he>> is disappointed. <<He>> turns to the messenger.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $TempleDuties.manor is 'accepted'>>
      “界线画得多仔细。”主教说，“看看两边各有什么吧。”<<He>>给你旧资料室中一份描述的索引，没有同时承诺能够治愈任何人。
    <<else>>
      主教收起索引。“约旦的职务就够你忙了，”<<he>>说。你看不出<<he>>是否失望，<<He>>转向传话者。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<temple-duty-back>>

:: Revelation Temple Kylar
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<location 'kylarmanor'>>
<<effects>>
<<temple-duty-check>>
<<if !_dutySafe or $TempleDuties.manor isnot 'accepted'
    or $temple_rank isnot 'priest' or $stalk or $controlled
    or C.npc.Kylar.init isnot 1 or !['active', 'rescued'].includes(C.npc.Kylar.state)
    or C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 30 or Time.hour lt 18 or Time.hour gte 23>>
  <<getouticon>>
  <<lanLink ['Return to the bedroom', '返回卧室'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>>
  <</lanLink>>
  <br>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Kylar>>
<<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Kylar watches you close the notebook. "Is it about that thing upstairs?" <<he>> asks. "I told you, I didn't know it was there." <<His>> hand tightens on the desk. "Who have you been talking to?"
    You open the sketch beside Kylar's keyboard and point to the broken metal at the top.
    <<if $LostLamb?.endings.includes('main')>>
      For a moment you remember the voice from your dream. Kylar notices your hesitation and leans closer.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    凯拉尔看着你合上笔记。“是楼上那个东西吗？”<<he>>问，“我说过，我以前不知道它在那里。”<<His>>手在桌沿收紧。“你和谁谈过？”
    你在凯拉尔的键盘旁打开草图，指向顶端残损的金属。
    <<if $LostLamb?.endings.includes('main')>>
      你短暂想起梦中的声音。凯拉尔发现你迟疑了一下，往前靠近。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>>
<<temple-duty-action `['Explain who asked, and let Kylar choose what can be written down (0:10)', '说明是谁询问，让凯拉尔决定哪些可以记下 (0:10)']` 10 'Revelation Temple Kylar Answer'>>
  <<if $TempleDuties.manor is 'accepted'>>
    <<set $TempleDuties.manor to 'copied'>>
    <<npcincr Kylar love 1>>
  <</if>>
<</temple-duty-action>>
<br>
<<refuseicon>>
<<temple-duty-action `['Put the notebook away and keep this conversation private (0:05)', '收起笔记，将这次谈话留在你们之间 (0:05)']` 5 'Revelation Temple Kylar Answer'>>
  <<set $TempleDuties.manor to 'declined'>>
<</temple-duty-action>>
<br>

:: Revelation Temple Kylar Answer
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<location 'kylarmanor'>>
<<effects>>
<<npc Kylar>>
<<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $TempleDuties.manor is 'copied'>>
      "Just the shape," Kylar says at last. "Nothing about my parents. Nothing about... me." You let <<him>> cross out a line, then read the description back. <<He>> keeps a copy. "Don't let them come here without telling me."
    <<else>>
      Kylar watches you put the notebook away. "You can still come here, can't you? Being a priest doesn't mean I have to talk to them." You assure <<him>> this conversation can end here. <<He>> turns the chair back towards you.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $TempleDuties.manor is 'copied'>>
      “只写形状。”凯拉尔终于说，“别写我的父母。别写……我。”你让<<him>>划掉一行，再读回描述。<<He>>留下一份副本。“别让他们不告诉我就来这里。”
    <<else>>
      凯拉尔看着你收起笔记。“你还是能来这里的，对吧？当了司祭，不代表我就得和他们谈。”你说明这次谈话可以到此为止。<<He>>把椅子转回你这边。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>>
<<lanLink ['Return to the bedroom', '返回卧室'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>

:: Revelation Temple Monstrance End
<<temple-duty-place>>
<<if $TempleDuties.manor isnot 'complete' or !$per_npc.bishop>>
  <<temple-duty-back>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<loadNPC 0 'bishop'>>
<<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The bishop reads the description of the broken metal. "And nothing more?" <<he>> asks. You tell <<him>> that is what Kylar agreed to share. <<He>> places it beside the older drawing; some lines match, and some do not. "Then that is what we have."
    The bishop draws a line beneath the description, then places the records fee beside it. <<He>> shuts the ledger before you can see the next entry. The sound follows you through the door.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    主教读过残损金属的描述。“没有别的？”<<he>>问。你说明，这就是凯拉尔同意分享的内容。<<He>>把纸放在旧图旁，有些线条吻合，有些不同。“那么，我们就只有这些。”
    主教在描述下划了一道线，把抄录的报酬放在纸旁。你还没看见下一条记录，<<he>>就合上账簿。那一声轻响跟着你穿过门。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<temple-duty-back>>
